3,Weipa - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weipa,"May 30, 2026 - Kugu Muminh (also known as Kuku-Muminh. See also related Wik languages) is one of the traditional languages that includes the landscape within the local government boundaries of the Cook Shire. Thaynakwith (also known as Awngthim, Tainikuit and Winduwinda) is an Australian Aboriginal language ...",Kugu-Muminh,Australian
