9,Australian Aboriginal Languages - Virtual Library - Home,https://www.dnathan.com/VL/index.php?category=4,"See also the main site at WAM (Western Australian Music and listen directly here via Soundcloud. https://wam.org.au/sounds-of-the-pilbara-ii-songs-in-language-launch/ This is the date when the item first appeared in this virtual library. It may have been changed or updated since then.10/05/2015 ... Archive deposit: documentation of highly endangered Paman languages of Cape York Peninsula including Kuuk Thaayorre, Wik Yi’anh, Kugu Muminh, Koko Bera, and Wik Mungkan.",Kugu-Muminh,Australian
